    <entry>
      <title>Prime to Irreducible</title>
      <link href="/2025/10/10/maths/%E7%B4%A0%20%E8%95%B4%E5%90%AB%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E7%BA%A6/"/>
      <url>/2025/10/10/maths/%E7%B4%A0%20%E8%95%B4%E5%90%AB%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E7%BA%A6/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>小文章</p></blockquote><p>在有消去律的交换幺半群上定义“素”与“不可约”。<br><span id="more"></span><br>定义有消去律的交换幺半群：</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">\begin{aligned}&(G,)\in \text{Ob(Cancellative Commutative Monoid)}\iff \\&(\forall a\in G\forall b\in G(ab=ba\in G))\\\land&(\forall a\in G\forall b\in G\forall c\in G((ab)c=a(bc))\\\land& (\exists 1\in G\forall a\in G(1a=a1=a))\\\land&(\forall a\in G\forall b\in G\forall c\in G((ac=bc)\to(a=b)))\end{aligned}</script><p>这些是之后要用到的喵喵工具。</p><p>定义 单位群：</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">G'=\\\{u\in G:\exists v\in G(uv=vu=1)\\\}</script><p>$G’$是群，非空（因为$1\in G’$），并记这样的$v$为$u^{-1}$</p><p>定义 相伴：</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">x\approx y\iff \exists u\in G'(y=ux)</script><p>容易验证  $\approx$  是等价关系：</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">\begin{aligned}&\forall x\in G(x\approx x)\\&\forall x\in G\forall y\in G\forall z\in G((x\approx y\land y\approx z)\to x\approx z)\\&\forall x\in G\forall y\in G((x\approx y)\to (y\approx x))\end{aligned}</script><p>定义 整除：</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">x|y\iff \exists a\in G(y=ax)</script><p>容易验证  $|$ 是偏序关系：</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">\begin{aligned}&\forall x\in G(x|x)\\&\forall x\in G\forall y\in G\forall z\in G((x|y\land y|z)\to x|z)\\&\forall x\in G\forall y\in G((x|y\land y|x)\to x\approx y)(0)\end{aligned}</script><p>前两条命题是显然的，但$(0)$命题是值得展开看看的。<br>显然地还有<script type="math/tex">\forall x\in G\forall y\in G(x\approx y\to (x|y\land y|x))</script><br>于是<script type="math/tex">(x|y\land y|x)\iff x\approx y</script><br>我们现在证明$(0)$命题：</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">\begin{aligned}&x|y\iff \exists a\in G(y=ax)\\&y|x\iff \exists b\in G(x=by)\\&\to y=ax=aby\\&\land x=by=bax\\&\to 1=ab=ba(00)\\&\to a\in G'\land b\in G'\\&\to x\approx y\end{aligned}</script><p>其中，推导出$(00)$用到了消去律。</p><p>定义 素元：</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">p\in P\subseteq G\iff p|st\to(p|s\lor p|t)</script><p>定义 不可约元：</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">q\in I\subseteq G\iff q\approx st\to(q\approx s\lor q\approx t)</script><p>定理：</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">st|x\to (s|x\lor t|x)</script><p>证明：由定义显然。<br>定理：素元是不可约元</p><script type="math/tex; mode=display">P\subseteq I</script><p>证明：由定义展开即可。</p>]]></content>
      
      
